{"type":"Film","id":"FR2023_213","slug":"fr2023-213-noel-joyeux","title":{"native":"Noël joyeux","english":"Christmas Unplanned"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2023-12-06","year":2023},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Clément Michel","slug":"clement-michel","name":"Clément Michel","birthYear":1974,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Comedy"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/26/36/271386/format_page/noel-joyeux.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sLmYLWjPV60"},"synopsis":{"native":"Noël chez les Barand, c'est sacré ! Surtout pour Vincent, le père, qui se fait une joie de voir toute sa famille réunie. Quand ses enfants annulent leur venue au dernier moment, il ne conçoit pas l'idée de passer les fêtes en tête à tête avec sa femme. Il décide donc de se rendre dans une maison de retraite afin de convier une pensionnaire esseulée à venir fêter Noël chez eux. Débarquent alors Monique et sa meilleure amie Jeanne qui vont très vite prendre leurs aises et semer un joyeux bazar...Pour tous les quatre, ce 24 décembre promet d'être aussi explosif qu'inattendu !","english":"Tomorrow is Christmas at Vincent and Beatrice Barand's house. Vincent is happy, it's his favorite day. Unfortunately, the whole family cancels at the last minute. Result: no children, no grandchildren… While Beatrice is looking forward to this romantic night, Vincent is devastated. He cannot imagine a Christmas Eve for two. So he decides to do a good deed and invites a lonely granny from a retirement house. What better way to rekindle the Christmas spirit? Yet, the couple's perfect Christmas Eve will turn sour when they host the most annoying grannies ever!"},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"FR2023_213_01","film":"FR2023_213","person":{"id":"Franck Dubosc","slug":"franck-dubosc","name":"Franck Dubosc","birthYear":1963,"deathYear":0,"ge